# Title: ShimCache Flush
# ID: b0524451-19af-4efa-a46f-562a977f792e
# Status: stable
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-02-01
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Detects actions that clear the local ShimCache and remove forensic evidence
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((cmdline:*rundll32* AND cmdline:*apphelp.dll*)) AND ((cmdline:*ShimFlushCache* OR cmdline:*#250*))) OR (((cmdline:*rundll32* AND cmdline:*kernel32.dll*)) AND ((cmdline:*BaseFlushAppcompatCache* OR cmdline:*#46*))))
